    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d613">

                <pb facs="0842" n="746" xml:id="pg746"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-09"><hi rendition="#italic">April 9,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 216.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that I have just
                    telegraphed you in cipher as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 9, 1898.</hi></p>
                        <p rendition="#flush">Assistant Secretary <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Day</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p>No change in situation. Spanish propositions of March 31 have not been
                            modified. It is still possible that armistice may be declared. I will
                            keep you fully advised.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodford.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>There are rumors this morning of a possible ministerial crisis, but I can not
                    verify them at this moment.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
